{"id":"4022160141184409127","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Dear @livenation.my , I have been seeing posts on Threads saying that there might not be fireworks for the BTS concert.\n\nIf this is indeed true, please reconsider this. It is not an indoor stadium and the fireworks would make a difference in the whole fan experience.\n\nBut most importantly, KL is the only SEA city that got 2 days when others get more and the fans have been waiting for 11 long years for them to come back again. We don’t even get solo member concerts.\n\nSo please reconsider!","username":"athinlyslicedhope","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@athinlyslicedhope/post/DfRlVaNCB4n","timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:41:14Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-03T14:46:53.215452242Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-03T14:46:59.329019Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-03T14:46:59.329019Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_305baccce43f41aa","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4022169792036012241","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"紀錄一下最近發生的一件荒謬事🤣\n\n一張價值 $4,700 的演唱會門票，\n就這樣被啃得面目全非……🙂\n\n原本想說 QR Code 還在，\n應該還是可以正常入場吧？\n\n但越想越不放心，\n所以還是打電話去問了 KKTIX。\n\n結果沒想到……\n竟然需要先去警察局報案，\n拿到報案三聯單才能後續處理？？？🤣\n\n於是就這樣……\n人生第一次因為演唱會門票被咬爛，\n跑去警察局報案。\n只好把其中一名嫌疑犯一起帶去了🙂\n\n說！！！到底是你們之中誰做的～～～🐹🐹🐹🐹\n\n一個個都給我裝無辜是不是！！😭😭😭","username":"meoutoto1210","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@meoutoto1210/post/DfRnh2QnQDR","timestamp":"2026-11-03T10:00:25Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-03T14:46:34.583781502Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-03T14:46:59.329019Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-03T14:46:59.329019Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_94b99b874254b7ad","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":false,"clean_exclusion_reason":"ticket_resale"}
